      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market is this Three-bed terraced house located in the popular Friars Green Development. The property is situated in Friars Green a popular development that was built in 2002 on the Tullow Road in Carlow. The property is within walking distance to local schools, Lidl and Eire Og playing fields, and Carlow Town with local bus stopping outside the estate.  The property is located adjacent to the large green area and benefits with off street parking to the front and small lawn area and small garden to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises entrance hallway with storage potential under the stairs, sitting room to the front open fire, kitchen/ diner and utility to the rear, with access to the rear garden area.  Upstairs comprises master bedroom to the front with fitted wardrobes and ensuite. The family bathroom is in the middle of the house with double bedroom  with fitted wardrobes and single bedroom to the rear. The property will suit a variety of buyers, especially firs time buyers. \r\n\r\nViewing is advised and strictly by appointment only\r\n\r\nAccommodation: \r\nHallway- 1.788m x 4.688m tiled floor \r\nSitting room- 3.242m x4.692m carpet, curtains, recess lighting, open fire\r\nKitchen- 3.586m x 5.159m laminate flooring, kitchen floor units, tiled splashback, curtains\r\nUtility 1.752m x 2.063m laminate flooeing, floor units, \r\nBedroom double rear- laminate flooring, fitted wardrobes, curtains\r\nBedroom single rear- 2.406m x 3.377m laminate flooring, curtains\r\nBathroom- 1.833m x 2.394m wood flooring, bath, electric shower, whb, wc, part tiled walls, velux window\r\nMaster bedroom- 3.006m x 3.444m laminate flooring, fitted wardrobes, curtains\r\nEnsuite- 1.587m x 1.761m wood florring, shower cubicle, part tiled walls, ec, whb\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The above particulars are issued by Maher Property Advisors on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only"
      },
